These are the test files used for debugging Heart of The Alien.
To try them out, rename such a file to "recorded-keys" and place it
in the same directory as "Alien" executable, and run Alien with
--replay, and --room with the room specified below.

An automated smoke/regression suite is available as well:

    powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File run-tests.ps1

It runs headless (SDL dummy video/audio) against the Windows build.

The key binding parser has a standalone test as well:

    gcc -I<sdl3>/include keymap_probe.c ../src/keymap.c ../src/platform.c -L<sdl3>/lib -lSDL3 -o keymap_probe
    ./keymap_probe
    ./keymap_probe keys-sample.txt

recorded-keys.level1 (room 1)
recorded-keys.level2 (room 2)
recorded-keys.boss (room 7, enter password to start at boss level)
recorded-keys.gameover-start (room 1, die at the lion and press Start on the
game-over screen to reach the password entry screen)
